   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The definite article",
     "texto": [
      "**O casă** means «a house»; **casa**, «the house». In many feminine nouns ending in **-ă**, the article changes that vowel to **-a**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Other nouns",
     "texto": [
      "With common masculine or neuter nouns, the article can be added as **-ul**: **un apartament → apartamentul** («an apartment → the apartment»). The Romanian article is part of the word; in English it comes in front."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Indefinite and definite",
     "columnas": [
